# Mana abilities are activated before the costs are paid (CR 601.2g-h), and Ashnod's Altar's sacrifice is a cost of one:
# Faithless Looting (Black Lotus) puts Black Lotus, itself and two Mountains in Bot1's graveyard, and Ashnod's Altar is cast
# beside a Memnite. On turn 3 Cling to Dust exiles Bot2's Island (Bot1 draws) and is in the graveyard with four other cards.
# On turn 5, with {B}{U} floating, its escape ({3}{B}, exile five other cards) is offered all the same: the Altar sacrificing
# Memnite for {C}{C} while it is cast pays the rest of the mana and makes Memnite the fifth card to exile. It exiles Bot2's
# Swamp, a noncreature card, and Bot1 draws again.

